01:26:38.880 --> 01:26:40.880 line:69%
 a renversé l'ancien équilibre. 

01:26:40.920 --> 01:26:42.080 line:63%
 Le moment est venu 
 de rebondir, 

01:26:42.120 --> 01:26:43.280 line:63%
