 de l'accompagnement 

01:31:53.440 --> 01:31:58.840 line:69%
 et du nombre de professeurs. 

01:31:58.880 --> 01:32:00.200 line:63%
 Encourageons 
 les vocations, aidons 

01:32:00.240 --> 01:32:01.240 line:63%
